===========================
Version Control Softwares
=========================

=> Project contains multiple developers

=> Developers will be working from different locations

Problem-1 : How to integrate all the developers code at one place

Problem-2 : How to monitor/track code changes

```
            - who
            - when
            - what
            - why
```

=> To resolve the above problems we will use Version Control Software

=> Version Control Systems help teams to:

```
    - Track code changes
    - Maintain history
    - Work in parallel
    - Create branches
    - Merge changes
    - Roll back changes
    - Collaborate with team members
```

=> We have several version control systems/platforms

```
            - Git
            - GitHub
            - GitLab
            - Bitbucket
            - Azure Repos
```

Note:

Git is the version control system.

GitHub, GitLab, Bitbucket etc. provide remote repository
hosting and collaboration features.

